    },
    "message": "Merge overlapping test fixtures and drop aliases and duplicated helpers\n\n- Demo: small_replay_demo takes paused and offline_compiler instead of the\n  separate paused_small_replay_demo and paused_offline_compiler_demo;\n  failure_day3_demo takes events_due_minute, and day3_demo is built with it.\n- Saved Runs: saved_run_with_scenario was saved_timeline with another return\n  value and is removed. saved_timeline is session-scoped, report_saved_run uses\n  it, and six test files use it instead of building the store, Run and first\n  Checkpoint by hand (the two _timeline helpers take it from their tests).\n- The demo, inspector and saved_run aliases are gone: their tests take\n  day3_demo, full_trace_inspector and report_saved_run directly.\n- _world_hash (four files) and the identical _router (three files) become\n  the shared demo_world_hash and recording_router fixtures.\n  test_support_priority keeps its own router for the default $10 budget.\n\nThe tests check the same things; the full offline run has the same counts.\n\nPart of #138.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
